{"title":"Ice Troll","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Troll that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/troll-heart\">Troll Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ice-troll\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ice-troll?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ice-troll?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>21</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ice-troll?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>13</td><td>in the wilds around -549, -762</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ice-troll?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>21</td><td>in the wilds around -560, -772</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 5 of 5 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 7 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 4 recorded drops, 94 total, 15–30 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×15–30</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rimehide-pelt\" title=\"Rimehide Pelt - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b7d951e5ff28740fde62.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimehide Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-arms\" title=\"Bearhide Arms - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9da825311bcf4ccc4c8a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-293.4px,913.1px)\"><i style=\"left:343.8px;top:-941.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:351.0px;top:-922.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:301.5px;top:-926.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:337.5px;top:-924.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:276.8px;top:-851.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:180.1px;top:-902.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:288.8px;top:-894.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:281.3px;top:-882.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:321.8px;top:-908.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:286.1px;top:-942.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:332.8px;top:-889.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:310.5px;top:-915.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:248.9px;top:-924.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:229.6px;top:-896.5px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -558, -771 <span class=\"muted\">· 13 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -743, -583 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -519, -720 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ice-troll\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Troll: <a href=\"#/monster/troll\">Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ice-troll-brute\">Ice Troll Brute</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll\">Redrock Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(27)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll\">Chalk Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper\">Troll Pitkeeper</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-shaman\">Troll Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-glutton\">Troll Glutton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll\">Barrow Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-king\">Troll King</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/9c3d5440ecd811b3cba0.svg\" alt=\"Ice Troll\"></div><h3>Ice Troll</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>20 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 20–21)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Troll</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>66</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>19 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}